  "step_3": "The decision reason is based on comparing the variance of the lotteries and preferring the one with smaller variance. The individual did not mention variance or any measure of dispersion. Instead, they focused on the loss amount (B has a smaller loss) and the probability of loss (B has a slightly higher risk). The individual's reasoning is inconsistent with the decision reason because they did not consider or reference variance. Even though B has a smaller variance (as calculated), the individual's justification is based on the magnitude of the loss, not on variance. Therefore, the individual did not use the variance-based decision reason. The reasoning described does not reflect the rule of preferring the lottery with smaller variance. Hence, the decision reason was not used.",
